      "value": "I can 100% agree with this. The third-party mods that used to be available gave us this ability, and that kind of customization allowed people to use very personalized images for their menu backgrounds. This was superior to having a limited selection provided by the game. However, this should not be something that should be a paid feature, as it was something we enjoyed for free previously.",
